\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   Jesus, before you we stand,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  and we want to be for you.
\par  We plead, come and strengthen us,
\par  and pay heed to our promise
\par  Give us your Holy Spirit!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  We proclaim before you today
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  Our Master we are for you
\par  Almighty our Father,
\par  Our Saviour Mighty God,
\par  Holy Spirit,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  our strong defender,
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Almighty the Lord!
\par  We will ne'er forget this
\par  all that we give as our promise!
\par  Have mercy on us.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2.  Yes, we've given our promise
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0   that we shall follow you;
\par   but we hold not our promise
\par   and we do forsake thee;
\par   And so come and strengthen us!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par We give ourselves to you again,
\par   and plead for your guidance!
\par   Our Father Almighty
\par   Our Saviour Almighty
\par   Holy Spirit
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Our strong defender
\par   Almighty the Lord
\par   Come and strengthen our faith
\par   and make us to look at your Love
\par   and love you always.
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-270\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. If people try to tempt us
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 to drag us in their sins,
\par then, Jesus, give us the strength,
\par and do not leave your children
\par and make us to fight so strong
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par When our lusts gives us much trouble
\par help us overpow'r them all.
\par Our Father Almighty,
\par Our Saviour Almighty,
\par Holy Spirit
\par our strong defender
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Almighty the Lord
\par Come and take our enemies
\par That we may be victory on them
\par \pard      and to follow you.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

